The embedded weights (weights.bin) were trained against features of the encoder sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
(Apache License 2.0, https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2). The encoder itself, an int8
dynamically quantized ONNX export, is not part of this package; it is downloaded on first use from the repository's
model/all-MiniLM-L6-v2-int8 folder or a mirror. See that folder's README.md for its provenance and license.
